#. Description of the plugin/theme
#: wp-content/themes/pub/reddle/style.css
msgid "Everything about Reddle's minimal design elegantly adapts to how you want to use your blog and what you want to use it for. Want to use your blog for a simple one-column link blog? A two-column business site with a custom header and no posts? Reddle can do that too &mdash; and look good doing it too."
msgstr "Temos Reddle minimalus ir elegantiškas dizainas leidžia Jums turėti tokį tinklalapį, kokio norite. Tai gali būti vieno stulpelio tinklaraštis arba dviejų stulpelio reprezentacinis tinklalapis. Reddle gali padėti abiem atvejais."

